ing areas, and manages movement.\n\nNearby Collection – Automatically collects nearby leaves while managing bag capacity.\n\nAutomatic Roaming – Searches for dense leaf areas and moves between productive farming spots.\n\nLayer Detection – Identifies productive leaf layers based on their height.\n\nGrid Farming – Tracks farming cells, cooldowns, failed locations, and cleared areas.\n\nAuto Deposit – Automatically deposits leaves when the bag is full or when a reset is needed.\n\nDumpster Selection – Detects available dumpsters and prioritizes usable deposit locations.\n\nZone Awareness – Selects dumpsters based on the current zone and requirements.\n\nStuck Recovery – Detects stalled farming and relocates to another area.\n\nEmpty Field Handling – Detects empty farming areas and waits or searches for another location.\n\nSmooth Movement – Glides between farming locations.\n\nGlide Speed – Adjusts the speed of smooth movement.\n\nDirect Repositioning – Quickly repositions when smooth movement is disabled or unnecessary.\n\nGround Positioning – Uses ground detection to position the character safely.\n\nAuto Buy Upgrades – Automatically purchases the cheapest affordable upgrade.\n\nAuto Buy Bag – Automatically purchases bag upgrades.\n\nAuto Buy Rake – Automatically purchases the Rake when affordable.\n\nAnti-AFK – Simulates input to help prevent AFK kicks.\n\nLive Status – Displays cash, leaves, bag capacity, farming mode, dumpster information, cash per minute, and leaves per minute.\n\nUnload – Stops active routines, removes the interface, and clears module state.\n\nLobby Detection – Detects whether you're in the supported lobby or an unsupported location.\n\nSolo Match Launcher – Automatically finds an open team square and starts a solo House match.\n\nMatch Configuration – Configures the match for one player and selects the House map.\n\nRe-entry Guidance – Displays instructions to reload the module after entering the match.\n\nClean the leaves, clean the leaves f